Third-party data and libraries

This license covers only the source code in this repository. The app loads
third-party libraries, imagery and data at runtime, each under its own terms:

- globe.gl and three-globe (MIT) - https://github.com/vasturiano/globe.gl
- Streamlit (Apache-2.0) - https://streamlit.io
- Natural Earth map data (public domain) - https://www.naturalearthdata.com
- NASA Blue Marble / night-lights imagery via three-globe
- World Bank, USGS, NASA EONET, OpenSky Network, Open-Meteo, Wikimedia,
  REST Countries, Frankfurter, Nager.Date and wheretheiss.at data - please
  follow each provider's attribution and fair-use terms, especially if you
  publish or redistribute the app. OpenSky data in particular is intended for
  non-commercial use unless you have agreed otherwise with the provider.
